2 CONT
2 CONT * In the source, the author describes the nobility, which were mentioned in two royal letters of 1347; namely Nils in Slandrom and Olav Håkonsson in Västanåker, and in front of them are in one of the letters Guttorm Dagfinsson (so
2 CONC n-in-law), which is "even more distinguished". (Source: Jemtland and Norway, page 104, Professor Edv. Bull, 1927) (Source: Skanke ätten, Roger de Robelin)
