1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Ide Hartvigsdatter Krummedige'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Familie'''	
2 CONT * Benedict III von Ahlefeldt,   f. ca. 1330, Grimstrup, Hunseby (Musse H., Maribo) ,   d. eft. 1398 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Børn''' 	
2 CONT * 	1. Henneke von Ahlefeldt,   d. eft. 1387
2 CONT * 	2. Carl von Ahlefeldt,   d. eft. 1398
2 CONT *+	3. Volf von Ahlefeldt, til Nøer og Grönwold,   d. eft. 1424, Gettorf, Eckernförde, Germany 
2 CONT *+	4. Ditlev von Ahlefeldt, til Grönwold,   d. 1432
2 CONT
2 CONT http://finnholbek.dk/getperson.php?personID=I20666&tree=2
2 CONT
2 CONT ----------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Was Ide really married to Claus? It would have been ecclesiastically next to impossible for a daughter (Cathrine) of the first wife to marry her mother's widower Benedict von Ahlefeldt) as his later wife.
2 CONT
2 CONT DAA 1982-4 says that it is unclear who was mother of any children of Benedict III von Ahlefeldt. It seems possible that Ide married only Benedict and died before 1350.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT references vbm: O.Brenner: Nachkommen Gorms des Alten. Lyngby, 1978 D.Schwennicke: Europäische Stammtafeln, Vol. XXII, Tafeln 1. Marburg, 2005 http://www8.informatik.uni-erlangen.de/cgi-bin/stoyan/l3/LANG=germ/F=Ide/N=Krummedige 2
2 CONC 01105130622
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT ---- '''Berte'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * Född:	uppskattas till mellan 1295 och 1330
2 CONT * Död:	efter 1379 
2 CONT
2 CONT * Hustru till Claus Limbek 
2 CONT * Moder till Anna Clausdatter Limbeck och Elisabeth Clausdatter Limbek 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT http://www.finnholbek.dk/genealogy/getperson.php?personID=I37999&tree=2 ----
