2 CONT ==[http://samla.raa.se/xmlui/bitstream/handle/raa/1098/1935_237.pdf?sequence=1&isAllowed=y SIGGE GUTTORMSSON TO LJUM AND HIS GRAVSTONE 1 ALVASTRA RECONSTRUCTION OF A 1200TH GRAPH OF SOLVE GARDELL]
2 CONT
