2 CONT
2 CONT Skjalm was earl of Sjælland and chieftan of Rügen. From him stem most of the known branches of "Hviderne" in Denmark. When Knud Lavard's parents went on a pilgrimage to The Holy Land he was raised with Skjalm. Anorna fortsätter ti
2 CONC ll Harald Blåtand: www.gbnf.com/genealogy/sahlin/html/d0032/I6302.HTM
