1 NAME Jens /Tillufsen Bielke/
2 GIVN Jens
2 SURN Tillufsen Bielke
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1510
2 PLAC Hunnestad
2 ADDR
3 CITY Skårby
3 STAE Skane County
3 CTRY Sweden
1 DEAT
2 DATE 14 OCT 1559
2 ADDR
3 CITY København
