2 CONT * https://danmarkshistorien.lex.dk/Niels_Olufsen_Bild,_ca._1260-1322
2 CONT * http://www.bornholm-stamtavle.dk/stamtavle/jochum/HTMLFiles/HTMLFiles_104/P5797.html
2 CONT * https://biografiskleksikon.lex.dk/Niels_Olufsen_Bild
2 CONT * http://books.google.dk/books?id=BCyrRZEGeJsC&pg=PA73&lpg=PA73&dq=peder+nielsen+neb&source=bl&ots=1qmWetDk7J&sig=51ziGYeOw0dBvNjaShYS4hxXrrE&hl=da&sa=X&ei=LoImVOz-D-roywPbk4DgDg&sqi=2&ved=0CDcQ6AEwBQ#v=onepage&q=peder%20nielsen%2
2 CONC 0neb&f=false
2 CONT * https://www.genealogi.dk/images/pht/1993_1/1993_1.pdf
