1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Nonne Gunner Palnesen (Palnyson) Schytte (born Aagensdatter), 1372 - 1430 Nonne Gunner Palnesen (Palnyson) Schytte (born Aagensdatter) was born in 1372, at birth place, to Aage Saxesesen Stenbrikke and Marianne Ste
2 CONC nbrikke (born Esbernsdatter Udsen). Nonne had 2 siblings: Cecilie Munk (born Aagesdatter Stenbrikke) and one other sibling. Nonne married Munk Peder (Petrus) Palnesøn (Palnyson) Schytte. Munk was born Before 1390. They had 3 child
2 CONC ren: Claus Pedersen Schytte and 2 other children. Nonne passed away in 1430, at age 58.
