1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Peder Uf. Born: circa 1380 Bornholm, Danmark. Title: Freeman (Frimand). Married: (?) circa 1420 ??? Ottesdatter Bild; Fyn, Danmark. Married: (?) ??? Lauridsdatter; Danmark. Residence: (Simblegård, Propr. Klemensker
2 CONC ?) Bornholm. Died: after 1416 Danmark. Miscellaneous: Coat-of-arms (Våben): a red chevron on white (en rødt sparre i hvidt).
2 CONT
2 CONT Note by Norman Madsen: That Peder Uf was married to either Otte Strangensen Bild's daughter or Laurids Jensen Markmand's daughter appears to be highly speculative. I know of no solid evidence for either theory.  
