1 NAME N.N. Steensen /el. Straale/
2 GIVN N.N. Steensen
2 _MARNM el. Straale
2 NICK NN von Falkenberg
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1365
1 DEAT
2 DATE AFT 1410
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''N.N. Steensen el. Straale'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Familie'''	
2 CONT * Otte Strangesen Bild, til Tange,   d. eft. 1397 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Børn''' 	
2 CONT * +	1. Anne Ottesdatter Bild, til Tange,   d. † (= Anne Ottesdatter Skinkel)
2 CONT * +	2. Jacob Ottesen Bild, til Ravnholt,   d. mellan. 1419 - 1460 ( Möjlig Skinkel och fosterson till Bild).
2 CONT
2 CONT http://finnholbek.dk/genealogy/getperson.php?personID=I75188&tree=2
2 CONT
2 CONT Barn?
2 CONT * Margrethe Ottesdatter Bild
2 CONT * Ottesdotter Bild
2 CONT
2 CONT Note
2 CONT * Roskildehistorie.dk says that Niels Jensen Rosenkrantz was married to either Anne Ottesdatter Skinkel or Anne Ottesdatter Bild, in some older genealogy family tree, the daughter Anne are listed as an Skinkel, it is possible, and
2 CONC  plausible, that Anne's mother first was married to Otto Skinkel, and after his death, remarried to Otte Bild.
2 CONT
2 CONT * Children in her first marriage, could have been fostered by Bild. N.N. Steensen el.Strale, were most likely born around 1365, and at this time in history, early pregnancy were quite common, women had also a tendency to easier be
2 CONC  able to have children up to their 50's, so for her being a mother as late as 1415 would not be impossible, any child with Bild would thus, if she was first married to Skinkel, have been earliest born after his death, ca.1398-1409
2 CONC  and bef. 1415. Otte Strangesen Bild are last noted as living 1397, when he exactly died are unknown. The daughter Anne Ottesdatter Bild are most likely born before ca. 1380, according to what her chronological course imply, (esti
2 CONC mations based on her husband, children, grandchildren, etc). 
2 CONT * Conclusion: Her first marriage with Skinkel should be considered as if, not yet proven. If she was only married to Bild, we still would face the likenesses that she had all of her children born as early as 1380 and as late as 14
2 CONC 15. If she were married to both, it is also plausible that Jakob Skinkel and Jakob Bild, are one and the same, just as Anne, having Otto Skinkel as their biological father and otte Bild as a foster father.
