1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Lodin (or Lodvik) was a boat captain at Bahus in 1362, and at Tunsberghus in 1369. References ↑ Kirkeby, Birger. Builder's book for Sauherad, gards and ottog . (Sauherad: Utgjevar Sauherad municipality, 1980-1988),
2 CONC  4: 517, Eight from Søum and Reine in Sandsvær.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.werelate.org/wiki/Person:Lodin_Eivindsson_(1)
2 CONT
2 CONT https://genvagar.nu/show.asp?PersonId=572621
2 CONT
2 CONT Eivind Raneson Sodheim  Birthdate: approx. 1280  Birthplace: Søndre Reine, Sandsvær, Kongsberg, Buskerud, Norway  Death: Died 1336 in Sandsvær, Kongsberg, Buskerud, Norway  Relatives: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Rane Jonsen Rani, to Gørslev and Kristina Alvsdatter to Thornberg  Husband of NN Petersdatter Halland  Father of Niculas Eivindsson Søum; Rane Eyvindsson and Lodin (Lodvik) Evindsson  Brother to Johannes Rani; Ranesdatter; 
