2 CONT Will of Anne Crane,  proved 15 May 1521, TNA PROB 11/20/165, which contains these clauses
2 CONT Item, I will that one Mass be sung at Scala Celi in Rome for the souls of me, Dame Anne
2 CONT Arundell; Andrew and Alice, my father and mother; Dame Alice, my grandam; Sir Ralph [sic Remfrey]
2 CONT Arundell, knight, Robert Crane, esquire, sometime my husbands; Ralph Arundel, Anne
2 CONT Crocker, Sir Edmund Arundell, knight, Raynfrey Arundell, George Crane, my children;
