2 CONT Item, I will and require mine executors that after my decease that they deliver unto
2 CONT Robert Crane, nephew and heir unto my husband, Robert Crane, all such plate and stuff
2 CONT of household and chattels as is specified in my husband’s will, Robert Crane, so he do
2 CONT according as it is written in my husband Robert Crane’s last will.
