2 CONT *1.1.3 '''Anders Andersen Kjærulff'''. b 1490 in Vadum. Married Marin Berthelsdatter. d 1577 in Øster Halne.
2 CONT *'''Children with Marin Berthelsdatter  ''' (b 1500 in Vestbæk. d in Øster Halne.):
2 CONT *1.1.3.1 Berthel Andersen Kjærulff. b 1528 in Øster Aslund. d 1568 in Øster Aslund.
2 CONT *1.1.3.2 Else Andersdatter Kjærulff. b 1530 in Vadum. d in Holte.
2 CONT *1.1.3.3 Johanne Andersdatter Kjaerulf
2 CONT *'''Children with NN''':
2 CONT *1.1.3.4 Maren Andersdatter Kjærulff. b 1550 in Ajstrup.
