2 CONC lender with Aalborghus, got 1559 letters on Han Hrds Provii, 1563 DRR and Provantmester, should with three other Rigsraader lead the Supervision in Jutland in Kongens Fravær, 1565 the lender with Rödinge Len, 1567 with Helsingborg
