2 CONT
2 CONT * Picture of Knutstorp before the fire in 1678. The picture is from Burman-Fischer's Prospektverk from 1680 and it can therefore be a reconstruction; inter alia missing the two towers that the main buildings should have had. - htt
2 CONC ps://www.geni.com/photo/view/4972646463380042917?album_type=photos_of_me&photo_id=6000000085080172109
