2 CONT * Landsjö 2014 - https://archive.org/details/Landsjo2014ReportWOsteology
2 CONT * Olsson, Martin (1932). "A group of round castles from Romanesque times on Sweden's east coast" . Fornvännen 27 . p. 273-304 . Read 19 February 2015 .
