1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Not  known 2nd husband of https://www.geni.com/people/Katharina-von-Braunschweig-L%C3%BCneburg-Markgr%C3%A4fin-zu-Mei%C3%9Fen-Pfalzgr%C3%A4fin-und-Kurf%C3%BCrstin-zu-Sachsen/6000000003827359630 married in 1443
